interfaces.definition:
Returned by every todo endpoint; existing keys unchanged, two appended.
{"id": 1, "title": "Pay rent", "done": false, "created_at": "2026-10-10T08:10:54.068302+00:00", "due_date": "2026-11-30", "overdue": false}
due_date: "YYYY-MM-DD" string or null. overdue: bool, true iff done is false AND due_date is not null AND date.fromisoformat(due_date) < app.storage.today_utc(). Both new keys always present.
